    direction LR
    G1["source_freshness_check<br/><b>failed</b>"] --> G2["dbt_pipeline<br/>upstream_failed"] --> G3["publish_to_catalog<br/>upstream_failed"]
  end
  F -->|"1 read the log · 2 fix the cause · 3 Clear the failed task, with Include Downstream"| R
